{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は気づいたら片想いの最後の個別握手会でした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来て下さった皆さんありがとうございましたヽ(・∀・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちょっと私体調が良くなくって、心配かけてしまいました(；ω；)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも元気なので気にしないで下さいね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お洋服などはまた今度紹介します！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はれなりんが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂46から卒業しました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ここでは多くは語りません。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"直接話したからね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ただ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私達はずっと親友だよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2014/07/21/4728734/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからもよろしくね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"へばなっ！⭐︎"}],"source":"archive"}